OL,3,CMadeleine McCann's brother cheered on
OL,4,Cby parents as he makes Commonwealth
OL,5,Cfinal
OL,7,FMadeleine McCann's younger brother
OL,8,FSean was cheered on by his parents and
OL,9,Ftwin sister Amelie as he booked his
OL,10,Fplace in the final of the 400 metres
OL,11,Ffreestyle event on his Commonwealth
OL,12,FGames debut.
OL,14,FMcCann finished fourth in the third of
OL,15,Ffour qualifying heats at Tollcross
OL,16,FInternational Swimming Centre in
OL,17,FGlasgow, his time of 3:52.64 just
OL,18,Fenough to squeeze him into Saturday
OL,19,Fevening's final in eighth position
OL,20,Foverall.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/7
