OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1785181693
OL,3,CMadeleine McCann's brother cheered on
OL,4,Cby parents as he makes Commonwealth
OL,5,Cfinal
OL,7,F"I wouldn't say I felt pressure, but I
OL,8,Fwas definitely nervous.
OL,10,F"There were so many people watching
OL,11,Fand I wanted to perform well, not just
OL,12,Ffor myself but for Team Scotland as
OL,13,Fwell.
OL,15,F"I'm glad I was able to produce a
OL,16,Fdecent performance."
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@AOUwD@AOUxD@TO]
