OL,3,CMadeleine McCann's brother cheered on
OL,4,Cby parents as he makes Commonwealth
OL,5,Cfinal
OL,7,FParents Gerry McCann, clad in a blue
OL,8,FTeam Scotland top, and Kate McCann,
OL,9,Fwho wore a T-shirt bearing the Games'
OL,10,Fanthem Yes Sir, I Can Boogie, are
OL,11,Fregular spectators at their son's
OL,12,Fswimming events.
OL,14,FThe 21-year-old, who studies chemical
OL,15,Fengineering at Loughborough
OL,16,FUniversity, previously represented
OL,17,FScotland at the Commonwealth Youth
OL,18,FGames in Tobago in 2023, where he
OL,19,Ffinished fifth in the 400m freestyle
OL,20,Fevent.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/7
