OL,3,CMadeleine McCann's brother cheered on
OL,4,Cby parents as he makes Commonwealth
OL,5,Cfinal
OL,7,FHe started swimming at an early age
OL,8,Fand was selected to swim at the City
OL,9,Fof Leicester club, with which he won
OL,10,Fmultiple county titles and became
OL,11,Fnational champion in his age group.
OL,13,FAlthough McCann grew up in England, he
OL,14,Fqualifies to represent Scotland
OL,15,Fthrough his father, Gerry, who was
OL,16,Fborn in Glasgow.
OL,18,FHis sister Amelie is a promising
OL,19,FScottish triathlete.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/7
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
