OL,3,CMadeleine McCann's brother cheered on
OL,4,Cby parents as he makes Commonwealth
OL,5,Cfinal
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FMcCann says he hopes to use his
OL,13,Fexperience at the Commonwealth Games
OL,14,Fto target a place in the Great Britain
OL,15,Fteam for the Los Angeles Olympics in
OL,16,F2028.
OL,18,F"The Olympics is always the ultimate
OL,19,Fgoal," he added.
OL,26,@zD@AOU{D@FO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/7
