CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F307A1785181693
OL,3,CMadeleine McCann's brother cheered on
OL,4,Cby parents as he makes Commonwealth
OL,5,Cfinal
OL,7,F"Being able to represent Scotland here
OL,8,Fis a really important stepping stone
OL,9,Ftowards that.
OL,11,F"Hopefully, with a couple more years
OL,12,Fof hard work, I can put my name in the
OL,13,Fmix."
OL,15,FBefore that, McCann will have further
OL,16,Fopportunities in the Tollcross pool,
OL,17,Fas he is expected to also compete in
OL,18,Fthe men's 800m and 1500m freestyle
OL,19,Fevents later in the Games.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUuD@EO]
